 "brief": "Hamas accused Israel's military of committing a war crime by striking a police headquarters in Gaza City Tuesday afternoon, the Shehab Wire reported. The Islamic Resistance Movement said the operation on the police command center represents a new war crime and reflects Prime Minister Benjamin Netanyahu's determination to reject ceasefire terms.\n\nThe strike targeted the police facility in Gaza City, where the enclave's security forces operate. Hamas characterized the attack as part of a broader pattern of violations, linking it to Netanyahu's stated position against halting military operations in Gaza.",
